{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119479","id":3686873675,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7bwTpL","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119479","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119479.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119479.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119479","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119479/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119479/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119479/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/d7de1d6c877df9e6854169d83041d014c5087a9e","number":119479,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Wayland: Fix logical and physical window size handling on KDE Plasma","user":{"login":"buresu","id":2587873,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1ODc4NzM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2587873?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/buresu","html_url":"https://github.com/buresu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/buresu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/buresu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/buresu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/buresu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/buresu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/buresu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/buresu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/buresu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/buresu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Details\r\nFixes several logical/physical window size conversion issues in Wayland HiDPI environments.\r\n\r\nGodot internally uses physical window sizes, while Wayland protocols use logical sizes.\r\nSeveral conversions between these coordinate spaces were missing or inconsistent, causing incorrect popup sizing ~~and IME positioning~~ under Wayland fractional scaling.\r\n\r\nThis PR also removes code that attempted to compensate for previously stored incorrect window sizes.\r\nExisting saved window geometry values may still contain invalid data in project and might need to be reset manually.\r\n\r\nThis resolves a large portion of Wayland HiDPI popup and window sizing issues.\r\n~~However, floating game window sizing during editor execution is still not fully fixed. Addressing this properly will require additional changes to the Wayland fractional scaling implementation and will be handled in a separate PR.~~(This issue is no longer reproducible now)\r\n\r\nTested on ArchLinux KDE Plasma 6.6.5 3840x2400 scale 250%\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n~~- Fixes incorrect IME popup positioning under fractional scaling~~(I split this out into PR #121571)\r\n- Fixes inconsistent logical/physical window size handling on Wayland\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097326,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTczMjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:linuxbsd","name":"platform:linuxbsd","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098255,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyNTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:platforms","name":"topic:platforms","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godoten